@page "/invitations/{Token}"

@*
    THE INVITATION VIEW. Story 4.3: AC2, AC3, AC4, AC6, AC7, AC9, AC13; FR-11, UX-DR18, UX-DR35, NFR-9.

    THE ONE SURFACE AN UNAUTHENTICATED STRANGER SEES (DESIGN.md:475). Reached without a Session - ClientRoutes
    lists it, so it is never bounced to sign-in and no context bar is drawn. The page URL carries the opaque token
    and nothing else; the token goes to the API in a request header (the view) or the body (the accept), never in a
    request URL (Lee's Q4 (a)), and is never stored.

    NOTHING LEAKS INTO A PREVIEW. The title stays the host page's fixed "Yello" - this page sets none, as no page does
    (UX-DR33) - there is no og: or twitter: metadata, and noindex is said twice: here, for browsers that run this, and as
    an X-Robots-Tag header from the static host (staticwebapp.config.json) for scrapers that do not.

    LOADING A URL IS NEVER ACCEPTANCE (FR-11 :277-278, AD-28). The view is read on arrival; the accept is sent only
    from a deliberate press - "Join {Space}", or the end of "Create an Account and join" - with an Idempotency-Key
    per press, kept for an identical resend after "Not sent.". Never optimistic: the page lands in the Space only
    after the 200.

    REGISTRATION FROM THE INVITATION (Lee's Q3 (a)) chains the unchanged registration route, then sign-in with the
    same credentials, then the accept. The email field is never pre-filled: the invited address is never echoed to
    a link holder (UX-DR18), and appears nowhere on this page.

    A DIFFERENT ACCOUNT is told so without either address, because the helpful version "discloses the invited
    address to whoever holds the link, which on a forwarded link is a stranger" (EXPERIENCE.md:265). Signing out
    stays here and re-reads the offer for no Session.

    Every state is its own @if block, so no copy is hidden behind an else.
*@

@using Yello.Client.Sessions
@using Yello.Client.Spaces

@inject IStringLocalizer<ClientCopy> Localizer
@inject InvitationCalls Calls
@inject SessionState Session
@inject SpaceDirectory Directory
@inject ActiveSpaceState ActiveSpace
@inject SpaceNarration Narration
@inject NavigationManager Navigation

<HeadContent>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
</HeadContent>

<div class="auth-surface">
    <section class="invitation-view">
        @if (_phase == InvitationViewPhase.Loading)
        {
            <p class="visually-hidden" role="status">@Localizer["InvitationLoading"]</p>
        }

        @if (_phase == InvitationViewPhase.Offer && _offer is not null)
        {
            <h1 class="type-dialog-title invitation-view__heading" tabindex="-1" @ref="_heading">@OfferHeading</h1>
            <p class="invitation-view__role">@JoinAsCopy</p>
            <p class="invitation-view__meaning">@RoleMeaningCopy</p>

            @if (IsAddressedToTheSession)
            {
                <button type="button" class="button-primary" disabled="@IsBusy" @onclick="JoinAsync">@JoinCopy</button>
            }

            @if (!IsAddressedToTheSession && _form == InvitationOfferForm.None)
            {
                <button type="button" class="button-primary" disabled="@IsBusy" @onclick="OpenRegistration">@Localizer["InvitationCreateAndJoin"]</button>
                <p class="invitation-view__aside">@Localizer["InvitationHaveAnAccount"] <button type="button" class="invitation-view__link text-link" @onclick="OpenSignIn">@Localizer["InvitationSignIn"]</button></p>
            }

            @if (!IsAddressedToTheSession && _form == InvitationOfferForm.Register)
            {
                <form class="invitation-view__form" @onsubmit="RegisterAndJoinAsync" @onsubmit:preventDefault>
                    <FormField FieldId="invitation-display-name"
                               Label="@(Localizer["DisplayNameLabel"].Value)"
                               Message="@(MessageFor(RegistrationFields.DisplayName) ?? Localizer["DisplayNameHint"].Value)"
                               Invalid="@(MessageFor(RegistrationFields.DisplayName) is not null)"
                               AutoComplete="name"
                               Disabled="@IsBusy"
                               @bind-Value="_displayName" />
                    <FormField FieldId="invitation-email-address"
                               Label="@(Localizer["EmailAddressLabel"].Value)"
                               Message="@MessageFor(RegistrationFields.EmailAddress)"
                               Invalid="@(MessageFor(RegistrationFields.EmailAddress) is not null)"
                               InputType="email"
                               AutoComplete="email"
                               Disabled="@IsBusy"
                               @bind-Value="_emailAddress" />
                    <FormField FieldId="invitation-password"
                               Label="@(Localizer["PasswordLabel"].Value)"
                               Message="@MessageFor(RegistrationFields.Password)"
                               Invalid="@(MessageFor(RegistrationFields.Password) is not null)"
                               InputType="password"
                               AutoComplete="new-password"
                               Disabled="@IsBusy"
                               @bind-Value="_password" />
                    <PrimaryButton Disabled="@IsBusy">@Localizer["InvitationCreateAndJoin"]</PrimaryButton>
                </form>
            }

            @if (!IsAddressedToTheSession && _form == InvitationOfferForm.SignIn)
            {
                <form class="invitation-view__form" @onsubmit="SignInAsync" @onsubmit:preventDefault>
                    <FormField FieldId="invitation-sign-in-email-address"
                               Label="@(Localizer["EmailAddressLabel"].Value)"
                               InputType="email"
                               AutoComplete="email"
                               Disabled="@IsBusy"
                               @bind-Value="_emailAddress" />
                    <FormField FieldId="invitation-sign-in-password"
                               Label="@(Localizer["PasswordLabel"].Value)"
                               InputType="password"
                               AutoComplete="current-password"
                               Disabled="@IsBusy"
                               @bind-Value="_password" />
                    <PrimaryButton Disabled="@IsBusy">@Localizer["InvitationSignIn"]</PrimaryButton>
                </form>
            }

            @* One polite region, in the page from the offer's first render and empty until something is said, so what
               is under way ("Joining.") and what came back ("Not sent.", the bound) are announced as they change. *@
            <p class="invitation-view__status" role="status">@StatusCopy</p>

            @if (!IsAddressedToTheSession)
            {
                <p class="invitation-view__footer">@Localizer["InvitationOwnSpace"]</p>
            }
        }

        @if (_phase == InvitationViewPhase.NotValid)
        {
            <h1 class="type-dialog-title invitation-view__heading" tabindex="-1" @ref="_heading">@Localizer["invitation-not-valid"]</h1>
            <p>@Localizer["InvitationNotValidBody"]</p>
            <p><a class="text-link" href="@ClientRoutes.Home">@Localizer["InvitationGoToYello"]</a></p>
        }

        @if (_phase == InvitationViewPhase.ForAnotherAccount)
        {
            <h1 class="type-dialog-title invitation-view__heading" tabindex="-1" @ref="_heading">@Localizer["invitation-for-another-account"]</h1>
            <p>@Localizer["InvitationForAnotherAccountBody"]</p>
            <div class="invitation-view__actions">
                <button type="button" class="button-primary" disabled="@IsBusy" @onclick="SignOutAsync">@Localizer["SignOutLabel"]</button>
                <a class="button-secondary" href="@ClientRoutes.Home">@Localizer["InvitationCancel"]</a>
            </div>
        }

        @if (_phase == InvitationViewPhase.Unavailable)
        {
            <h1 class="type-dialog-title invitation-view__heading" tabindex="-1" @ref="_heading">@Localizer["InvitationUnavailable"]</h1>
            <p><a class="text-link" href="@ClientRoutes.Home">@Localizer["InvitationGoToYello"]</a></p>
        }
    </section>
</div>
